      "stream_id": "T01",
      "role": "TRANSFER",
      "confidence": 0.98
    },
    {
      "paper_id": "doi-10-3115-1708376-1708410",
      "decision": "ADMIT",
      "reason": "T02. The paper detects decision discussions, distinguishes dialogue-act roles including the issue and its resolution, and extracts decision phrases from the source dialogue. That directly strengthens transfer evidence for separating discussion/proposal material from actual resolution and for retaining grounded decision evidence.",
      "stream_id": "T02",
      "role": "TRANSFER",
      "confidence": 0.99
    },
    {
      "paper_id": "2303.16763",
      "decision": "ADMIT",
      "reason": "T01. The VERIFIED paper contributes a manually annotated meeting action-item corpus and explicitly models both local and global conversational context, with experiments on Chinese meetings and AMI. This materially strengthens evidence about context-dependent action-item detection beyond isolated-utterance classification.",
      "stream_id": "T01",
      "role": "TRANSFER",
      "confidence": 0.98
    },
    {
      "paper_id": "manual-0839b98ee7",
      "decision": "ADMIT",
